          "explanation": "Harari rejects 'European exceptional curiosity' as an explanation. China had compass, gunpowder, printing, paper, and naval technology centuries before Europe used them. Islamic scholars had preserved Greek mathematics and developed algebra. India had sophisticated mathematics and metallurgy. The difference was not raw intellectual energy but how Europe fused science with capitalism and empire into a self-reinforcing feedback loop. Without that triangle, curiosity alone produced beautiful manuscripts but not industrial revolutions.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why Europe — structural, not cultural</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">OTHERS WERE CURIOUS TOO</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">China, India, Islam led for centuries</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">in many key technologies</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"460\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">EUROPE'S DIFFERENCE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Combined science with capitalism</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">and empire — the triangle locked</text>\n                </svg>",
            "caption": "Test your understanding"
          }
