        "explanation": "Harari distinguishes objective reality (true regardless of belief, like gravity), subjective reality (existing in one mind, like a private headache), and **inter-subjective** reality, which lives in the shared imagination of a large group. Money, nations, gods, and corporations are inter-subjective: they outlast any individual sceptic, yet they would evaporate if the entire network abandoned the belief. That is why a lone person cannot 'wake up' out of the imagined order; changing it requires switching the beliefs of millions at once.",
        "visual": {
          "type": "diagram",
          "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">What defines an inter-subjective reality?</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"190\" width=\"900\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">LIVES IN THE NETWORK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Not in any single mind</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Not in the physical world</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"378\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">In the space between millions of minds</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"430\" width=\"430\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SURVIVES</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Any one doubter</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">walking away</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"430\" width=\"430\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">COLLAPSES</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">If everyone stops</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">believing at once</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"680\" width=\"700\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE CONSEQUENCE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">No one escapes the imagined order alone</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"828\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">You can only trade one story for another</text></svg>",
          "caption": "Test your understanding"
        }
